        %td The affiliation of user
  
  %h2 Program Usage

  %p
    The start of a program session is a “launch” event in KeyServer.
    There were 9,989 program sessions recorded in the trailing week of August 6, 2026.
    The events were additionally filtered out by requiring a non-null “Foreground” larger than 1 second.  
    This indicates interaction with the program.  
    This filtered the events to 7.5% (752 events) of the original sample.

  %p
    %strong Note:
    KeyReporter can't apply these filters, so its downloads include every event in the time frame.

